## Binaural Doppler — 25 minutes
##
## Acoustic parameters mirrored from a public curated session library;
## score re-authored in SBaGen .sbg format.
## Independent work - not affiliated with or endorsed by any third party.
##
##
## the reference doppler effect (a slow cyclic detune) has no entrain
## equivalent yet; it is emulated by drifting the beat a little on
## each phase change. Entrain glides pitch phase-continuously, so
## every step is a smooth slide, never a restart.
##
## A 250 Hz carrier alternating alpha (10 Hz) and theta (5 Hz)
## phases, the beat wandering +/-1 Hz as it goes.

off: -
alpha-a: 250+10/20
alpha-b: 250+11/20
theta-a: 250+5/20
theta-b: 250+4/20

00:00:00 off
00:00:15 alpha-a
00:05:00 alpha-b
00:10:00 theta-a
00:15:00 alpha-a
00:20:00 theta-b
00:22:00 alpha-b
00:24:00 theta-a
00:25:00 off
